 "slot_change_request": "Native-AUD33975 independent-root split below qfd_tt_ctlm. Existing DCU2/DUC2 distributed one stage per leaf: zero new station edges. Engine native local clock enable comes from synthesis-pruned duplicate controller predictor, with its OWN two explicitly accounted program SRAMs and direct duplicated head input pins. No clock or enable is forwarded, no shared parent CTS, no idle-gate waiver. Actual issuing head retains FULL operation fields/18-bit rows and original TP8 G3072 tree/tag stores. Candidate parent layout648x280.8: head237.6square at(0,0),tree388.8x280.8 at(259.2,0),21.6um channel. Requires actual original475.2square slot revision; interim seam pins headE/treeW at40..84(cmd380),92..104(ret95), other pins provisional pending top-down die assignment. This replaces the failed AUD64 candidate, which is NOT submitted/adopted.",
 "job": {
  "owner": "Codex:qwen-tt-split",
  "branch": "claude/el1013-qwen-r3b-host",
  "tag": "split1",
  "purpose": "Native idle/supply-preserving controller/tree split with engine-local pruned gate predictor; full TP8 fields/18-bit rows; no clock/enable forwarding and zero added station stages. Production behavior must pass strict flat33975 comparison before routes.",
  "extra_paths": [
